+	 * surface's data with another's metadata (read on the phone: SRC0 e5007000 with SRC2 e5a00000, slots 0x500000
+	 * apart) and the decoder flagged nearly every frame. A linear frame after UBWC ones gets the plane's linear
+	 * registers back, as they were at the first UBWC flip.
